      "id": "trezTnZnlWaWDGzdKTJlC",
      "originalText": "注意 1：A01～A13 依次依赖；显式选择前置。A14 随时结束。校相未收敛保留诊断和输出状态，允许重试，禁止扫描。"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 1972,
      "width": 1532,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "注意 2：扫描调幅必须先 OFF → set_amplitude() → 按已校准 phase 重新触发，禁止每点重配 setup_sine()，避免 Burst 模式退出与相位跳变。",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7c2d12",
