      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "roundness": null,
      "id": "mYcAKcFZ6S6C9PUn21u1R",
      "originalText": "注意 2：扫描调幅必须先 OFF → set_amplitude() → 按已校准 phase 重新触发，禁止每点重配 setup_sine()，避免 Burst 模式退出与相位跳变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 2002,
